Third-party parts:
- src/core/ps3eye_camera.cpp: OV534/OV772x register tables, frame-rate table and payload
  parser derived from the Linux kernel gspca ov534 driver (GPL-2.0-or-later) as packaged in
  https://github.com/inspirit/PS3EYEDriver.
- src/source/*: Media Foundation virtual camera scaffolding adapted from
  https://github.com/smourier/VCamSample, MIT License, Copyright (c) 2024-2026 Simon Mourier
  (full text in src/source/LICENSE-VCamSample.txt).
- libusb (https://libusb.info), LGPL-2.1, statically linked; complete source of this program
  is provided so it can be relinked against a modified libusb.
